  "subject": {
    "id": "ccr11-public-evidence-pack",
    "type": "DOCUMENT"
  },
  "summary": "Publish a reproducible Small Shop evidence trail and repair clean-clone CI portability.",
  "why": "The first end-to-end milestone was understandable but its exact proof remained scattered, and public CI exposed six portability or evidence-retention faults. This revision links the source, ontology, neutral facts, contracts, independent expectation, ledger receipt, graph result, and refusal test in one newcomer path. It preserves the dated GraphRecipe report as immutable evidence, makes its exact archived bytes testable, retains a formerly dangling governed candidate under a non-release evidence tag, and repairs test-only Python, pathlib, Git, and Sphinx assumptions without changing protocol semantics."
}
